--!strict
--[[
	Every rarity's card frame, as layers, from the upgrade card design
	(design_handoff_upgrade_cards, data/frames.json), converted by a script
	and not edited by hand. Regenerate it rather than tuning it here.

	Units are design pixels on a 134 x 330 card, origin at its top left, y
	down. A shard's base is the bottom centre of the shard before rotation,
	and it turns about that point, clockwise in degrees. `parts` are drawn in
	order over the card body; `shards` behind it. A paint is a colour and a
	transparency; an outline, ring or glow is a paint and a width.
]]

